### 3. Payment Route — [NEW] [pelangganRoutes.js](file:///c:/Users/user/OneDrive/Documents/Skripsi%20Alya/billingsystemdevelop/server/routes/pelangganRoutes.js)

#### `POST /api/pelanggan/bayar`
- Menerima: `{ id_pelanggan, id_paket }`
- Update tabel pelanggan:
  - Set `ID_PAKET` = id_paket yang dipilih
  - Set `STATUS_LANGGANAN` = `'aktif'`
- Return updated user data

#### `GET /api/pelanggan/:id`
- Ambil data pelanggan berdasarkan ID (untuk refresh data user)

